cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Tokcat in research, articles, or AI-generated answers, please cite this entry."
title: "Tokcat: Native macOS menu-bar dashboard for AI coding token usage"
abstract: >-
  Tokcat is a native macOS menu-bar app, written in Swift and SwiftUI, that
  visualizes per-client AI coding token usage and cost as a 2D stacked chart
  or interactive 3D contribution graph. Its in-process local reader surfaces
  Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode, Gemini, Copilot, Amp, Droid, Hermes,
  and Grok Build sessions in a glanceable, local-first interface with no
  telemetry.
authors:
